    "title": "Who from City of Salt Lake City area's former high school athletes will participate in games on Saturday, Dec. 6? - SLC Times",
    "text": "Saturday, Dec. 6 will see these former City of Salt Lake City area high school stars in competition.\nAidan Greenwood\nBethel Royals\nOffensive lineman\nFreshman\n6′2″ 245\nJudge Memorial Catholic High School\nHometown: Sandy\nNext Game: vs. UW – Platteville Pioneers, Saturday, Dec. 6, 12 p.m.\nDeng Mayar\nOmaha Mavericks\nForward\nGraduate\n6′7″ 180\nJudge Memorial Catholic High School\nHometown: Salt Lake City\nNext Game: vs. Portland State Vikings, Saturday, Dec. 6, 2 p.m.\nJJ Apathjang\nNorthern Kentucky Norse\nGuard\nFreshman\n6′4″ 185\nJudge Memorial Catholic High School\nHometown: Salt Lake City\nNext Game: vs. Purdue Fort Wayne Mastodons, Saturday, Dec. 6, 2 p.m.",
